#: scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 781f869b2181c13805e140a9d670f0650db9e8488257d67e8b28c1ac5d9190e0
